{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18119","headline":"庭楸 · 韩愈","name":"庭楸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庭楸止五株，共生十步间。\n各有藤绕之，上各相鈎联。\n下叶各垂地，树颠各云连。\n朝日出其东，我常坐西偏。\n夕日在其西，我常坐东边。\n当昼日在上，我在中央间。\n仰视何青青，上不见纤穿。\n朝暮无日时，我且八九旋。\n濯濯晨露香，明珠何联联。\n夜月来照之，蒨蒨自生烟。\n我已自顽钝，重遭五楸牵。\n客来尚不见，肯到权门前。\n权门衆所趋，有客动百千。\n九牛亡一毛，未在多少间。\n往既无可顾，不往自可怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}